From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:32:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add Chelsea, PSG and samalive color schemes (v1.4.2)

- chelsea-light: club blue #034694 header, gold/red/light-blue signals
- psg-dark: navy #004170 paper, club red #DA291C header, gold accents;
  header buttons use the navy paper so they are not white-on-white
- samalive-dark: teal shadows / orange highlights taken from the
  photographer's teal-and-orange grading
- footer "Komari Monitor" link gets a per-scheme colour where the accent
  fell below 4.5:1 on the footer band (also fixes Catppuccin Latte and
  Tokyo Night Day, which were 1.5:1 and 1.0:1)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017zt6qgJTYX8RkfDpxVcSTg
